The '''Crooked Artifact''' is a {{Rare}} [[Accessory]] that gives its user {{green|2%}} off on most shops.

== Obtaining ==
=== Shop Purchase ===
The '''Crooked Artifact''' can be purchased from {{NPCSprite|Lucius}} for {{c|2,000,000}} and a {{Item|Shady Ring}} after buying 3 items from the [[Dark Auction]].

If the player loses the item, it can be repurchased from {{NPCSprite|Rusty}} in the {{zone|Gold Mine}} for {{c|2,000,000}}.

